          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generated-qed-cross-section\">Generated QED cross section</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Generate <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(e^-e^+\\to\\mu^-\\mu^+||)</marimo-tex>, sum and average the incoming spins,\nand contract the generated numerator with Idenso. The massive squared\nmatrix element is retained; its massless limit is integrated over two-body\nphase space below. This reproduces the unpolarized result in the\n<a href=\"https://feyncalc.github.io/FeynCalcExamples/QED/Tree/ElAel-MuAmu\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">FeynCalc example</a>.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
    },
    {
      "id": "bkHC",
