    },
    {
      "id": "lEQa",
      "code_hash": "12619e7b239e0cfb3d2ef835822debaf",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/html": "<div style='display: flex;flex: 1;flex-direction: column;justify-content: flex-start;align-items: normal;flex-wrap: nowrap;gap: 0.5rem'><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Massless angular distribution</strong> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d\\sigma/d\\Omega||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">1/4\u00b7cos_theta\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2/s<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>1/4\u00b7alpha\u00b2/s</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Mandelstam distribution</strong> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(d\\sigma/(dt\\,d\\varphi)||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">alpha\u00b2/s\u00b2<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7t\u00b7alpha\u00b2/s\u00b3<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 205, 0)\">+</span>2\u00b7t\u00b2\u00b7alpha\u00b2/s\u2074</div><span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><span class=\"paragraph\"><strong>Both coordinates give the integrated cross section</strong> <marimo-tex class=\"arithmatex\">||(\\sigma=4\\pi\\alpha^2/(3s)||)</marimo-tex></span></span><div style=\"white-space: pre-wrap; margin: 0;\">4/3\u00b7<span style=\"color: rgb(205, 0, 205)\">\ud835\udf0b</span>\u00b7alpha\u00b2/s</div></div>"
          }
        }
