          "type": "data",
          "data": {
            "text/markdown": "<span class=\"markdown prose dark:prose-invert contents\"><h2 id=\"generated-polarized-qed-cross-section\">Generated polarized QED cross section</h2>\n<span class=\"paragraph\">Spenso constructs the chiral projectors and Idenso evaluates their traces.\nThe currents below select right-chiral fermion wavefunctions; in the\nmassless limit these describe right-handed particles and left-handed\nantiparticles. No initial spin average is taken for specified states.\nApply the projectors to the generated interaction vertices. Cut particle\nidentities and orientations fix the physical outgoing momenta.</span></span>"
          }
        }
      ],
      "console": []
